        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R4312, Scroll 4 Inch x 12 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch x 12 Inch Scroll Register with Damper has a traditional design that makes it a great choice for historic  home remodels or if you just want to add a classic look to your home. This model has a damper on it so you'll be able to control the air flow into the room. The Scroll 4 Inch x 12 Inch Register with Damper is available in 5 finishes including satin nickel, black, and polished brass.  Easy to install, this floor vent will fit in any 4x10 floor opening. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-10-inch-scroll-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r4410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Scroll Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-14-inch-scroll-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r4414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Scroll Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Scroll 4 Inch x 12 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
